ke",128.64,128.84],["electricity.",128.84,129.38],["And",129.96,130.32],["as",130.32,130.5],["the",130.5,130.68],["water",130.68,130.9],["goes",130.9,131.18],["down,",131.18,131.56]]},{"id":"s0028","startFrame":3962,"durationInFrames":114,"text":"things are coming up. A waterfall chamber seven stories tall","media":"image","subject":"Waterfall chamber re-emerging in Glen Canyon (Lake Powell low, 2026)","subjectType":"event","words":[["things",132.06,132.34],["are",132.34,132.5],["coming",132.5,132.76],["up.",132.76,133.06],["A",133.06,133.76],["waterfall",133.76,134.12],["chamber",134.12,134.74],["seven",134.74,135.1],["stories",135.1,135.6],["tall",135.6,135.86]]},{"id":"s0029","startFrame":4076,"durationInFrames":108,"text":"that people called the most beautiful place in the canyon.","media":"image","subject":"Waterfall chamber in Glen Canyon (revealed, 2026)","subjectType":"event","words":[["that",135.86,136.46],["people",136.46,136.74],["called",136.74,137],["the",137,137.16],["most",137.16,137.4],["beautiful",137.4,137.92],["place",137.92,138.38],["in",138.38,138.58],["the",138.58,138.7],["canyon.",138.7,139.08]]},{"id":"s0030","startFrame":4184,"durationInFrames":155,"text":"A stone bridge that went under in 1969. A ghost town.","media":"image","subject":"Re-emerging stone bridge and ghost town at Lake Powell (2026)","subjectType":"event","words":[["A",139.48,139.78],["stone",139.78,140.16],["bridge",140.16,140.52],["that",140.52,140.8],["went",140.8,140.98],["under",140.98,141.38],["in",141.38,141.62],["1969.",141.62,142.6],["A",143.36,143.5],["ghost",143.5,143.74],["town.",143.74,144.16]]},{"id":"s0031","startFrame":4339,"durationInFrames":158,"text":"A brand new waterfall that by every rule of geology should not exist.","media":"video","subject":"New waterfall at Lake Powell (2026)","subjectType":"event","words":[["A",144.64,144.74],["brand",144.74,145],["new",145,145.22],["waterfall",145.22,145.72],["that",145.72,146.08],["by",146.08,146.26],["every",146.26,146.7],["rule",146.7,146.98],["of",146.98,147.18],["geology",147.18,147.68],["should",147.68,148.28],["not",148.28,148.58],["exist.",148.58,149.24]]},{"id":"s0032","startFrame":4497,"durationInFrames":137,"text":"And underneath all of it, something that's been hidden for more than a hundred years.","media":"image","subject":"Lake Powell low water exposing canyon floor","subjectType":"event","words":[["And",149.9,150.04],["underneath",150.04,150.4],["all",150.4,150.64],["of",150.64,150.78],["it,",150.78,150.96],["something",151.24,151.56],["that's",151.56,151.82],["been",151.82,151.96],["hidden",151.96,152.26],["for",152.26,152.54],["more",152.54,152.78],["than",152.78,152.96],["a",152.96,153.06],["hundred",153.06,153.34],["years.",153.34,153.7]]},{"id":"s0033","startFrame":4634,"durationInFrames":83,"text":"Now, I want to be careful here.","media":"image","subject":"Glen Canyon Dam and Lake Powell","subjectType":"place","words":[["Now,",154.46,154.78],["I",155.24,155.84],["want",155.84,156],["to",156,156.14],["be",156.14,156.22],["careful",156.22,156.54],["here.",156.54,156.84]]},{"id":"s0034","startFrame":4717,"durationInFrames":90,"text":"Because Lake Powell is only 63 years old.","media":"image","subject":"Because Lake Powell","subjectType":"place","words":[["Because",157.22,157.64],["Lake",157.64,157.88],["Powell",157.88,158.14],["is",158.14,158.46],["only",158.46,158.72],["63",158.72,159.22],["years",159.22,159.8],["old.",159.8,160.24]]},{"id":"s0035","startFrame":4807,"durationInFrames":127,"text":"So how could anything under it have been hidden for a hundred?","media":"image","subject":"Lake Powell low water exposing previously submerged terrain","subjectType":"event","words":[["So",160.24,160.88],["how",160.88,161.14],["could",161.14,161.32],["anything",161.32,161.84],["under",161.84,162.28],["it",162.28,162.5],["have",162.5,162.66],["been",162.66,162.88],["hidden",162.88,163.1],["for",163.1,163.38],["a",163.38,163.52],["hundred?",163.52,163.86]]},{"id":"s0036","startFrame":4934,"durationInFrames":194,"text":"I'd love to tell you it's an old shipwreck or a buried treasure. It isn't. It's stranger than that.","media":"video","subject":"Shipwreck and buried treasure (illustration)","subjectType":"object","words":[["I'd",164.46,164.78],["love",164.78,164.92],["to",164.92,165.08],["tell",165.08,165.3],["you",165.3,165.44],["it's",165.44,165.66],["an",165.66,165.74],["old",165.74,165.98],["shipwreck",165.98,166.5],["or",166.5,166.9],["a",166.9,167.04],["buried",167.04,167.26],["treasure.",167.26,167.64],["It",168.08,168.42],["isn't.",168.42,168.82],["It's",169.1,169.44],["stranger",169.44,169.82],["than",169.82,170.04],["that.",170.04,170.36]]},{"id":"s0037","startFrame":5128,"durationInFrames":247,"text":"The thing that's been hidden for a century isn't sitting on the bottom of the lake. It's the reason the lake is disappearing. And it was written down on a piece of paper","media":"image","subject":"Lake Powell waterline dropping","subjectType":"event","words":[["The",170.94,171.06],["thing",171.06,171.22],["that's",171.22,171.46],["been",171.46,171.6],["hidden",171.6,171.82],["for",171.82,172.06],["a",172.06,172.16],["century",172.16,172.6],["isn't",172.6,173],["sitting",173,173.34],["on",173.34,173.5],["the",173.5,173.6],["bottom",173.6,173.84],["of",173.84,174.02],["the",174.02,174.14],["lake.",174.14,174.32],["It's",174.9,175.1],["the",175.1,175.22],["reason",175.22,175.6],["the",175.6,175.8],["lake",175.8,176.04],["is",176.04,176.28],["disappearing.",176.28,176.86],["And",177.4,177.6],["it",177.6,177.68],["was",177.68,177.8],["written",177.8,178.08],["down",178.08,178.38],["on",178.38,178.56],["a",178.56,178.66],["piece",178.66,178.86],["of",178.86,179.02],["paper",179.02,179.34]]},{"id":"s0039","startFrame":5375,"durationInFrames":188,"text":"in 1922. We'll get there. I've spent the last week going through the old river logs,","media":"image","subject":"Colorado River river logs","subjectType":"document","words":[["in",179.34,179.58],["1922.",179.58,180.52],["We'll",180.94,181.22],["get",181.22,181.36],["there.",181.36,181.58],["I've",182.14,182.5],["spent",182.5,182.66],["the",182.66,182.8],["last",182.8,183.04],["week",183.04,183.3],["going",183.3,183.58],["through",183.58,183.84],["the",183.84,183.98],["old",183.98,184.28],["river",184.28,184.58],["logs,",184.58,185.02]]},{"id":"s0040","startFrame":5563,"durationInFrames":210,"text":"the bureau of reclamation data, the satellite images and the stories of the people who saw this place before the water came.","media":"image","subject":"Bureau of Reclamation Lake Powell data and satellite imagery","subjectType":"object","words":[["the",185.42,185.5],["bureau",185.5,185.84],["of",185.84,186.14],["reclamation",186.14,186.5],["data,",186.5,187.04],["the",187.04,187.5],["satellite",187.5,187.96],["images",187.96,188.46],["and",188.46,188.86],["the",188.86,188.98],["stories",188.98,189.34],["of",189.34,189.5],["the",189.5,189.62],["people",189.62,189.88],["who",189.88,190.06],["saw",190.06,190.32],["this",190.32,190.54],["place",190.54,190.78],["before",190.78,191.14],["the",191.14,191.32],["water",191.32,191.52],["came.",191.52,191.84]]},{"id":"s0041","startFrame":5773,"durationInFrames":175,"text":"And I'll be honest with you, I came in thinking this would be a story about some rocks coming out of a lake.","media":"image","subject":"Lake Powell receding shoreline and newly exposed rocks","subjectType":"event","words":[["And",192.42,192.7],["I'll",192.7,192.84],["be",192.84,192.94],["honest",192.94,193.18],["with",193.18,193.42],["you,",193.42,193.68],["I",194,194.34],["came",194.34,194.54],["in",194.54,194.72],["thinking",194.72,194.98],["this",194.98,195.26],["would",195.26,195.36],["be",195.36,195.48],["a",195.48,195.58],["story",195.58,195.9],["about",195.9,196.18],["some",196.18,196.44],["rocks",196.44,196.68],["coming",196.68,197],["out",197,197.24],["of",197.24,197.32],["a",197.32,197.44],["lake.",197.44,197.6]]},{"id":"s0042","startFrame":5948,"durationInFrames":82,"text":"I came out of it angry, a little heartbroken,","media":"image","subject":"Stranded marina infrastructure at Lake Powell","subjectType":"event","words":[["I",198.28,198.38],["came",198.38,198.56],["out",198.56,198.74],["of",198.74,198.84],["it",198.84,198.96],["angry,",198.96,199.36],["a",199.84,199.94],["little",199.94,200.1],["heartbroken,",200.1,200.68]]},{"id":"s0043","startFrame":6030,"durationInFrames":188,"text":"and unable to look at that blue water the same way again. Let me show you what I found.","media":"video","subject":"Lake Powell blue water contrasted with high-water stain","subjectType":"event","words":[["and",201,201.18],["unable",201.18,201.66],["to",201.66,201.96],["look",201.96,202.2],["at",202.2,202.36],["that",202.36,202.52],["blue",202.52,202.78],["water",202.78,203.12],["the",203.12,203.34],["same",203.34,203.72],["way",203.72,204.02],["again.",204.02,204.44],["Let",205.4,205.88],["me",205.88,206],["show",206,206.18],["you",206.18,206.3],["what",206.3,206.44],["I",206.44,206.56],["found.",206.56,206.86]]},{"id":"s0044","startFrame":6218,"durationInFrames":138,"text":"Start with the postcard. If you've seen a photo of Lake Powell, you know the look.","media":"image","subject":"Lake Powell (postcard view)","subjectType":"place","words":[["Start",207.26,207.48],["with",207.48,207.68],["the",207.68,207.78],["postcard.",207.78,208.28],["If",208.82,209],["you've",209,209.16],["seen",209.16,209.34],["a",209.34,209.48],["photo",209.48,209.78],["of",209.78,210.02],["Lake",210.02,210.16],["Powell,",210.16,210.48],["you",210.84,210.9],["know",210.9,211.02],["the",211.02,211.16],["look.",211.16,211.44]]},{"id":"s0045","startFrame":6356,"durationInFrames":121,"text":"Deep blue water snaking between towering walls of orange sandstone.","media":"image","subject":"Lake Powell sandstone canyon walls","subjectType":"place","words":[["Deep",211.88,212.04],["blue",212.04,212.4],["water",212.4,212.74],["snaking",212.74,213.24],["between",213.24,213.64],["towering",213.64,214.4],["walls",214.4,214.62],["of",214.62,214.94],["orange",214.94,215.22],["sandstone.",215.22,215.9]]},{"id":"s0046","startFrame":6477,"durationInFrames":169,"text":"Houseboats tied up in hidden coves, jet skis cutting white lines across the surface.","media":"video","subject":"Lake Powell recreation (houseboats and jet skis)","subjectType":"event","words":[["Houseboats",215.9,217],["tied",217,217.2],["up",217.2,217.4],["in",217.4,217.54],["hidden",217.54,217.72],["coves,",217.72,218.28],["jet",218.74,218.86],["skis",218.86,219.28],["cutting",219.28,219.52],["white",219.52,219.86],["lines",219.86,220.18],["across",220.18,220.5],["the",220.5,220.74],["surface.",220.74,221.1]]},{"id":"s0047","startFrame":6646,"durationInFrames":117,"text":"It's one of the most photographed lakes in America, and for millions of people","media":"image","subject":"Lake Powell tourism photography","subjectType":"event","words":[["It's",221.54,221.86],["one",221.86,221.98],["of",221.98,222.08],["the",222.08,222.18],["most",222.18,222.4],["photographed",222.4,222.86],["lakes",222.86,223.18],["in",223.18,223.32],["America,",223.32,223.72],["and",223.98,224.24],["for",224.24,224.4],["millions",224.4,224.84],["of",224.84,225.06],["people",225.06,225.42]]},{"id":"s0048","startFrame":6763,"durationInFrames":124,"text":"it's the definition of a summer on the water. It's enormous.","media":"video","subject":"Lake Powell","subjectType":"place","words":[["it's",225.42,225.8],["the",225.8,225.92],["definition",225.92,226.44],["of",226.44,226.7],["a",226.7,226.78],["summer",226.78,227.12],["on",227.12,227.32],["the",227.32,227.44],["water.",227.44,227.72],["It's",228.3,228.48],["enormous.",228.48,228.88]]},{"id":"s0049","startFrame":6887,"durationInFrames":131,"text":"When it's full, it runs about 186 miles up the Colorado River","media":"image","subject":"Colorado River","subjectType":"place","words":[["When",229.56,229.76],["it's",229.76,229.96],["full,",229.96,230.2],["it",230.64,230.74],["runs",230.74,230.96],["about",230.96,231.24],["186",231.24,232.4],["miles",232.4,232.68],["up",232.68,232.92],["the",232.92,233.04],["Colorado",233.04,233.46],["River",233.46,233.92]]},{"id":"s0050","startFrame":7018,"durationInFrames":102,"text":"from the dam, and it has more shoreline than the entire west","media":"image","subject":"Glen Canyon Dam","subjectType":"place","words":[["from",233.92,234.2],["the",234.2,234.34],["dam,",234.34,234.58],["and",235.04,235.14],["it",235.14,235.28],["has",235.28,235.4],["more",235.4,235.72],["shoreline",235.72,236.28],["than",236.28,236.48],["the",236.48,236.6],["entire",236.6,236.94],["west",236.94,237.34]]},{"id":"s0051","startFrame":7120,"durationInFrames":157,"text":"coast of the United States. All those twisting side canyons add up.","media":"video","subject":"Lake Powell","subjectType":"place","words":[["coast",237.34,237.62],["of",237.62,237.88],["the",237.88,238.02],["United",238.02,238.22],["States.",238.22,238.76],["All",239.32,239.6],["those",239.6,239.9],["twisting",239.9,240.3],["side",240.3,240.66],["canyons",240.66,241.2],["add",241.2,241.48],["up.",241.48,241.78]]},{"id":"s0052","startFrame":7277,"durationInFrames":76,"text":"Here's what the postcard doesn't tell you.","media":"image","subject":"Lake Powell","subjectType":"place","words":[["Here's",242.56,242.86],["what",242.86,242.96],["the",242.96,243.06],["postcard",243.06,243.44],["doesn't",243.44,243.78],["tell",243.78,243.98],["you.",243.98,244.22]]},{"id":"s0053","startFrame":7353,"durationInFrames":129,"text":"Every one of those beautiful coves is the top of a canyon,","media":"image","subject":"Lake Powell","subjectType":"place","words":[["Every",245.1,245.5],["one",245.5,245.82],["of",245.82,246.04],["those",246.04,246.24],["beautiful",246.24,246.66],["coves",246.66,247.26],["is",247.26,247.7],["the",247.7,247.86],["top",247.86,248.14],["of",248.14,248.32],["a",248.32,248.44],["canyon,",248.44,248.84]]},{"id":"s0054","startFrame":7482,"durationInFrames":141,"text":"and every one of those canyons goes down, hundreds of feet down.","media":"video","subject":"Lake Powell","subjectType":"place","words":[["and",249.4,249.76],["every",249.76,250.02],["one",250.02,250.22],["of",250.22,250.34],["those",250.34,250.5],["canyons",250.5,251.08],["goes",251.08,251.5],["down,",251.5,251.9],["hundreds",252.44,252.72],["of",252.72,252.88],["feet",252.88,253.04],["down.",253.04,253.44]]},{"id":"s0055","startFrame":7623,"durationInFrames":186,"text":"To a place that before 1963 had a name, Glen Canyon.","media":"image","subject":"Glen Canyon","subjectType":"place","words":[["To",254.1,254.32],["a",254.32,254.44],["place",254.44,254.82],["that",254.82,255.38],["before",255.38,256.04],["1963",256.04,256.82],["had",256.82,257.7],["a",257.7,257.82],["name,",257.82,258.2],["Glen",258.96,259.22],["Canyon.",259.22,259.76]]},{"id":"s0056","startFrame":7809,"durationInFrames":177,"text":"In 1869, a one armed civil war veteran named John Wesley Powell took a handful","media":"image","subject":"John Wesley Powell","subjectType":"person","words":[["In",260.3,260.58],["1869,",260.58,261.42],["a",261.92,262],["one",262,262.28],["armed",262.28,262.6],["civil",262.6,262.92],["war",262.92,263.24],["veteran",263.24,263.56],["named",263.56,264],["John",264,264.3],["Wesley",264.3,264.78],["Powell",264.78,265.14],["took",265.14,265.68],["a",265.68,265.86],["handful",265.86,266.22]]},{"id":"s0058","startFrame":7986,"durationInFrames":210,"text":"of men in wooden boats down the Colorado River into territory no American map had ever filled in.","media":"image","subject":"Colorado River map (19th century)","subjectType":"document","words":[["of",266.22,266.46],["men",266.46,266.72],["in",266.72,267.02],["wooden",267.02,267.3],["boats",267.3,267.6],["down",267.6,267.92],["the",267.92,268.08],["Colorado",268.08,268.44],["River",268.44,268.84],["into",268.84,269.34],["territory",269.34,269.9],["no",269.9,270.58],["American",270.58,271.12],["map",271.12,271.44],["had",271.44,271.84],["ever",271.84,272.08],["filled",272.08,272.4],["in.",272.4,272.7]]},{"id":"s0059","startFrame":8196,"durationInFrames":152,"text":"When they floated into the stretch, the walls opened up into something they didn't expect.","media":"image","subject":"Glen Canyon","subjectType":"place","words":[["When",273.2,273.38],["they",273.38,273.52],["floated",273.52,273.9],["into",273.9,274.2],["the",274.2,274.38],["stretch,",274.38,274.78],["the",274.98,275],["walls",275,275.2],["opened",275.2,275.6],["up",275.6,275.8],["into",275.8,276.04],["something",276.04,276.46],["they",276.46,276.72],["didn't",276.72,277.04],["expect.",277.04,277.58]]},{"id":"s0060","startFrame":8348,"durationInFrames":81,"text":"Smooth, glowing sandstone.","media":"image","subject":"Glen Canyon","subjectType":"place","words":[["Smooth,",278.28,278.88],["glowing",279.36,279.64],["sandstone.",279.64,280.4]]},{"id":"s0061","startFrame":8429,"durationInFrames":160,"text":"Side canyons full of ferns and hanging gardens. Shallow water you could wait across.","media":"image","subject":"Glen Canyon hanging gardens","subjectType":"place","words":[["Side",280.96,281.26],["canyons",281.26,281.74],["full",281.74,281.96],["of",281.96,282.14],["ferns",282.14,282.64],["and",282.64,282.8],["hanging",282.8,283.1],["gardens.",283.1,283.52],["Shallow",284.12,284.58],["water",284.58,284.78],["you",284.78,284.96],["could",284.96,285.08],["wait",285.08,285.24],["across.",285.24,285.54]]},{"id":"s0062","startFrame":8589,"durationInFrames":195,"text":"Powell called it Glen Canyon. In one huge alcove, the sound of the water and their voices echoed","media":"image","subject":"John Wesley Powell","subjectType":"person","words":[["Powell",286.3,286.72],["called",286.72,287.04],["it",287.04,287.26],["Glen",287.26,287.54],["Canyon.",287.54,288.02],["In",288.66,288.82],["one",288.82,289.04],["huge",289.04,289.5],["alcove,",289.5,290.1],["the",290.4,290.52],["sound",290.52,290.84],["of",290.84,291.02],["the",291.02,291.12],["water",291.12,291.4],["and",291.4,291.62],["their",291.62,291.76],["voices",291.76,292.14],["echoed",292.14,292.8]]},{"id":"s0063","startFrame":8784,"durationInFrames":98,"text":"so beautifully that he named it Music Temple.","media":"image","subject":"Music Temple","subjectType":"place","words":[["so",292.8,293.04],["beautifully",293.04,293.52],["that",293.52,294.04],["he",294.04,294.22],["named",294.22,294.5],["it",294.5,294.66],["Music",294.66,295.02],["Temple.",295.02,295.42]]},{"id":"s0064","startFrame":8882,"durationInFrames":140,"text":"The lake is named after him. Keep that in mind. It's going to matter.","media":"image","subject":"John Wesley Powell","subjectType":"person","words":[["The",296.08,296.22],["lake",296.22,296.48],["is",296.48,296.94],["named",296.94,297.18],["after",297.18,297.68],["him.",297.68,297.98],["Keep",297.98,298.78],["that",298.78,298.96],["in",298.96,299.1],["mind.",299.1,299.38],["It's",299.68,299.82],["going",299.82,299.94],["to",299.94,300.08],["matter.",300.08,300.34]]}]}